# Finite supplied-context warm initializer; no trim/tail/audio output policy.
# Caller must bind PCM/features/periods to one admitted canonical carrier and
# admitted model resources before Plan. All three outputs are one proposal.
# This reproduces fargan_cont numerical state, including period3 after five calls.
plot speech/fargan-warm-start (
    >> pcm_context: NumericF32Vector320
    >> features0: NumericF32Vector20
    >> period0: FarganPeriod
    >> features1: NumericF32Vector20
    >> period1: FarganPeriod
